abstract: >-
  JOB-AGENT is a source-available, local-first application for discovering,
  filtering, analyzing, and tracking job opportunities. The current release
  integrates HigherEdJobs, while its job-board architecture supports future
  source-specific extensions. It combines browser automation, deterministic
  provisioning, local large-language-model analysis, document-requirement
  discovery, transactional report publication, and privacy-preserving external
  user data.
